        <mxCell id="Ru7CVLNHCat8ClbN-CE9-22" value="&lt;b&gt;Evaluate as per the criteria&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;- Ability to operate independently and autonomously.&lt;br&gt;- Technical capability and competence in relevant skills, systems, or technologies&lt;br&gt;- Compliance with applicable standards, regulations, and internal policies&lt;br&gt;- Commercial evaluation, including pricing and cost transparency&lt;br&gt;- Payment terms and financial conditions&lt;br&gt;- Delivery lead time, including the ability to meet required timelines&lt;br&gt;- Delivery terms and responsibilities&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;- Any applicable penalty or liquidated damages clauses&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Mandatory document:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;- Terms and conditions applicable to installers&lt;br&gt;- Terms and conditions applicable to labour agents and contractors&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFE0;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontColor=#484848;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=10;meaKind=note;" parent="1" vertex="1">
